# Hypothesis memory

Before implementing any **new** strategy, query the log:

```python
from ht_backtest.memory import prior_for_category, query_log
print(prior_for_category("<timing|volume|range|cross-asset|pattern>"))
print(query_log(category="...", signal_type="..."))
```

Or: `ht-backtest memory` / `ht-backtest memory --category volume`.

Do not re-test an exhausted category/signal with a cosmetic parameter tweak. Prefer unexplored categories or a genuinely different signal type. Batch runs append to `data/memory/hypothesis_log.csv` automatically and print PRIOR RESULTS at start.
